            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Depuis %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Someone just tried to unlock your Mac!" : {
      "comment" : "Intrusion alert of iCloud meant for the iPhone (iOS key). Another Mac of the account may show it too.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quelqu’un vient d’essayer de déverrouiller ton Mac !"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take your iPhone with you. Beyond %@, Locky locks your Mac. Then come back: Locky unlocks it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prends ton iPhone avec toi. Au-delà de %@, Locky verrouille ton Mac. Reviens ensuite : Locky le déverrouille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Texte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text under the logo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Texte sous le logo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks for being part of the trip." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Merci de faire partie du voyage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks to everyone who has walked away from their Mac since %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Merci à tous ceux qui s’éloignent de leur Mac depuis %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code comes out of the boxes and compiles again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le code ressort des cartons et recompile."
